    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pd6dipd",
      "content": "Agreement between INC and Muslim League ensuring Hindu-Muslim unity and acceptance of separate electorates."
    },
    {
      "id": "8o37gst",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. KHILAFAT MOVEMENT (1919–1924)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pk6mb0b",
      "content": "Led by Ali Brothers to protect Ottoman Caliph. Gandhi supported it; later declined after abolition of Caliphate."
    },
    {
      "id": "95vbqk9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. SIMON COMMISSION (1927)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kv5b8z2",
      "content": "All-British commission; boycotted nationwide with slogan 'Simon Go Back'."
    },
    {
      "id": "wp9nw83",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. NEHRU REPORT (1928) & LAHORE SESSION (1929)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "s1tyui7",
      "content": "Nehru Report demanded Dominion Status; Lahore Session declared Purna Swaraj (26 January 1930)."
    },
    {
      "id": "fp524rc",
      "type": "heading",
