      "content": "9. CABINET MISSION PLAN (1946)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lxkuuhy",
      "content": "Proposed Constituent Assembly and federal structure; initially accepted but later failed."
    },
    {
      "id": "kgx4dov",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10. MOUNTBATTEN PLAN (1947) & PARTITION"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yqypd8h",
      "content": "Announced partition of India; led to Indian Independence Act 1947 and creation of India and Pakistan."
